---
import { site, education } from "../data/site";
import Icon from "./Icon.astro";
---

<section id="about" class="rule-t section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">04 — About</p>
      <h2 class="mt-3 text-headline">
        I'd rather understand why something is slow
        <span class="italic text-moss">than guess at a patch.</span>
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="grid-12">
      <!-- Prose -->
      <div class="col-span-12 space-y-4 leading-relaxed md:col-span-7">
        <p>
          I started with the MERN stack, then moved into Angular professionally when
          I joined Softrefine Technology. Working on a live recruitment platform
          taught me the part tutorials skip — how software behaves once real users
          depend on it.
        </p>
        <p>
          My work sits across the stack. On the front I'm strongest in Angular with
          TypeScript, and build in React too. Behind it I write Node and Express,
          work in Core Java, and design REST interfaces against MySQL, PostgreSQL
          and MongoDB. I care about the seam between the two, where most performance
          problems actually live.
        </p>
        <p>
          The 40% improvement I mention came from that habit — nobody asked for it. I
          read the network panel, found the same payload being fetched repeatedly, and
          traced it back to how the module resolved its state. That's the kind of work
          I look for.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Sidebar -->
      <aside class="col-span-12 mt-8 space-y-6 md:col-span-4 md:col-start-9 md:mt-0">
        <div>
          <p class="tag">Education</p>
          <ul class="mt-2 space-y-3">
            {
              education.map((entry) => (
                <li>
                  <p class="meta">{entry.period}</p>
                  <p class="mt-0.5 text-sm leading-snug">{entry.degree}</p>
                  <p class="text-sm text-ink-faint">{entry.school}</p>
                </li>
              ))
            }
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div>
          <p class="tag">Languages</p>
          <p class="mt-1.5 text-sm text-ink-soft">Gujarati (native) · Hindi · English</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <p class="tag">Currently</p>
          <p class="mt-1.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
            Leading three modules of Talent Recruit at Softrefine Technology, and
            reading through NestJS and system design in the evenings.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <p class="tag">Elsewhere</p>
          <div class="mt-2 flex gap-2">
            <a
 href={site.github}
 target="_blank"
 rel="noopener noreferrer"
 class="icon-btn"
 aria-label="GitHub profile"
            >
              <Icon name="github" size={15} />
            </a>
            <a
 href={site.linkedin}
 target="_blank"
 rel="noopener noreferrer"
 class="icon-btn"
 aria-label="LinkedIn profile"
            >
              <Icon name="linkedin" size={15} />
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
